    "why": "under label-independence E[AUROC] = 0.5 whatever the class prior is, while E[accuracy] is the majority rate. The accuracy instrument divides by `accuracy - majority rate`, which is the same quantity as the prior/stump margin, so it is blind exactly where the KPI is weakest (runs/leakage_power.json: phi_min 1.112 kc1, 4.051 blood-transfusion). The rank statistic has no such denominator.",
